  "description": "Experience the epitome of relaxation and leisure with our super comfortable cruiser-style eBike. Designed for those who value comfort and enjoyment above all else, the Stunner Auto offers a relaxed riding experience like no other.\nFeatures:\n\nPowerful Motor: Equipped with a 750W Bafang BBS02 Mid-drive Motor for smooth and efficient riding.\nHill Climbing Capability: With 120Nm of torque, tackle any hill on your path with ease.\nMultiple Frame Options: Choose from Step-Over or Step-Thru options to get the eBike that will fit you perfectly!\nLofandi 3 Speed Automatic Drivetrain: Experience the freedom of no gears to shift with the Automatic hub, which adjusts the gear to your cadence demands!\nThumb Throttle: On-demand throttle makes pedalling optional, giving you the freedom to ride at your own pace.\nSmooth Pedal Assistance: Cadence sensor ensures smooth and powerful pedal assistance for a seamless riding experience.\nLong-lasting Battery: Includes a high-capacity battery and charger for extended riding adventures.\n\nBenefits:\n\nEnjoy a relaxed and enjoyable riding experience with our cruiser-style eBike.\nConquer hills effortlessly while staying cool, calm, and collected.\nBring along everything you need for your adventures with the generous load capacity.\nRide at your own pace with optional pedalling thanks to the on-demand throttle feature.\nExperience smooth and powerful pedal assistance for a seamless riding experience.\nRide for miles without worrying about running out of power with the long-lasting battery.\n\nElevate your riding experience with our super comfortable cruiser-style eBike. Make every journey a relaxing and enjoyable adventure.",
